    {
      "name": "decode",
      "title": null,
      "description": "Inspect a method or class. Exactly one method descriptor, method_idx (with file_id), or class descriptor is required. Classes default to paginated summaries; methods default to paginated smali. Follow next_offset for exact text continuation; context mode lists original line numbers for labels and catch directives. Query SQL tables for annotations and debug metadata.",
